2026-11-14T09:47:50.9878363Z [36;1m  # The hoisted layout nests several copies of a patched package (e.g. @ai-sdk/openai-compatible),[0m
2026-11-14T09:47:50.9878948Z [36;1m  # and Bun applies the patch once per copy; concurrent renames into the same cache entry race[0m
2026-11-14T09:47:50.9879521Z [36;1m  # with ENOTEMPTY. Every attempt starts from an empty cache because the loser may leave it partial.[0m
