2026-11-14T09:47:50.9880870Z [36;1m    rm -rf "$cache_dir"[0m
2026-11-14T09:47:50.9881123Z [36;1m    rm -rf node_modules[0m
2026-11-14T09:47:50.9881648Z [36;1m    if bun install --no-cache --cache-dir "$cache_dir" --linker hoisted ; then[0m
